# Cursor Rules: Vercel-Pro

## /journey & Dev Logging
When the user types `/journey`, `/devlog`, or asks to document their journey:
- Follow the instructions in `.agents/skills/journey/SKILL.md`.
- Extract git commit hash, branch, and GitHub URL using `.agents/skills/journey/scripts/gather-git-context.ps1`.
- Document:
  1. What was built & accomplished.
  2. Twists & turns (challenges faced & errors).
  3. Mitigation strategy (what failed first & the winning fix).
  4. Architecture & Mermaid flow diagram.
  5. GitHub commit mapping.
- Save to `docs/journey/` and ADRs to `docs/adr/`.
